  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你是否曾被悄悄摸到身后的苦力怕吓到过？&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模组或许能解决这个问题。</span></p><p><del><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">新增\"优先目标\"附魔。应用于<strong>胸甲</strong>时，该附魔会在HUD上提示</span></del></p><p><del><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>是否有（1级）或有多少（≥2级）怪物正在以你为目标</strong></span></del></p><p><del><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">（在特定范围内）。</span></del></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">自1.18.2-2.0.0版本起，该附魔不再需要并已被移除。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/459/540/targetdemo.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"262\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">🔧<strong>可配置项</strong>：</span></p><ul><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">统计附近以玩家为目标的生物数量的刷新间隔；</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">统计范围的宽度与高度；</span></li><li><del><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">\"优先目标\"是否为宝藏附魔；</span></del></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>❗注意</strong>：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">本模组的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.wargaming.net%252fen%252fShip%253aList_of_Commander_Skills%2523Priority_Target\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">创意</a>源自经典海战游戏<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fworldofwarships.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">《战舰世界》</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Fabric版本的模组需要<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge配置API移植</a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">您<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>完全可以</strong></span>将此模组加入您的整合包。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
